{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50430","headline":"四二 · 王梵志","name":"四二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"停（一本作「庭」。\n）客勿叱狗{右上加卄}，对客莫频眉。\n供给千余自，（「自」，斯三三九三、斯四六六九卷作「日」。\n）临时请不饥。\n（「临时」，伯三六五六卷作「临歧」，伯三七一六卷作「临政」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_50430.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_50430","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}